# Level 3: Advanced Analytics & Business Intelligence

This directory contains the completed Level 3 tasks for the Codveda Technologies Data Analytics Virtual Internship. This phase demonstrates end-to-end predictive modeling using supervised machine learning in Python and executive business intelligence dashboard development in Power BI.

---

## 📁 Repository Structure

```text
Level_3/
├── Codveda_Level_3_Task_1_Classification.ipynb   # Predictive classification & ensemble modeling notebook
├── Codveda_Level_3_Task_2_Dashboard.pbix         # Power BI interactive report file
├── churn_dashboard_overview.png                  # Executive dashboard screenshot
├── model_comparison_and_importance.png           # Feature importance & model comparison charts
├── roc_curve.png                                 # ROC-AUC evaluation curves
└── README.md                                     # Task documentation
